<section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        
        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>How long until I see results?</h3>
            <p>Most treatments take 6-12 weeks to show significant improvement. Consistency is key – stick with your treatment plan and attend follow-up appointments.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>Is isotretinoin (Accutane) safe?</h3>
            <p>Isotretinoin is safe when properly monitored. We closely supervise all patients on this medication with regular blood tests and check-ups. It's highly effective for severe acne.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>Will my acne come back after treatment?</h3>
            <p>Many patients experience long-term improvement, especially with isotretinoin. However, some may need maintenance therapy. We'll work with you to develop a plan for lasting results.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>Can you treat acne scars?</h3>
            <p>Yes! We offer multiple scar treatment options including microneedling, chemical peels, and laser therapy. The best approach depends on your scar type.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
